        "tekst": "**Two traps in this step**\n\n**The headline trap.** Headlines exaggerate (\"AI could kill all humans in next decade\"). The article underneath usually balances it (\"...but how seriously should we take them?\"). Your gist must reflect the article, not the headline.\n\n**The first-paragraph trap.** News articles often open with a story or a dramatic quote. That opening is almost never the [[main point|Main point]]. Do not let it become your first sentence."
