        "tekst": "**Your first assignment, grouped**\n\nYour actual summary used three paragraphs: introduction; threats plus critics; irresponsible companies plus regulation plus Wachter's objections. The third paragraph was about 280 words and covered three themes: the paragraph that is really two paragraphs (session 2).\n\n**A grouping that fits the lecturer's model better:**\n\n**Group A, \"the threat\":** ASI could end or overpower humanity; insiders put a number on it.\n**Group B, \"the cause and the cure\":** firms race ahead with too little care; hence calls for international, safety-first regulation.\n**Final paragraph, \"the disagreement\":** warners versus sceptics: how likely the threat is (Rogoyski) and which risks are real (Wachter).\n\nThe critics move out of the threat paragraph and into the final paragraph, where the lecturer wants the opposing sides. Nothing new is added; the same points are only regrouped."
