        "tekst": "**Opening paragraph for your first assignment, built sentence by sentence**\n\n**S1 (what):** Artificial superintelligence (ASI) is a hypothetical form of artificial intelligence that would exceed human abilities in nearly every domain.\n**S2 (why now):** Its possible development has led to growing concern among researchers, politicians and people working inside the AI industry itself.\n**S3 ([[topic sentence|Topic sentence]] for the whole summary):** Some experts warn that such systems could threaten the survival of humanity, blame AI companies for prioritising speed over safety and call for international regulation, whereas others regard these fears as exaggerated or misdirected.\n**S4 (stakes):** The disagreement therefore concerns both how serious the risk is and how governments should respond to it.\n\n(about 90 words)\n\n**Compare with what you wrote.** Your opening was good on content: it defined ASI and named the threat and the call for regulation. Two improvements: it did not announce the **opposing view**, which is half the article; and its last sentence was long and packed three ideas together with a semicolon. Splitting it into S3 and S4 above makes the plan visible."
